.SchurWeyl.one_le_hook","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.one_le_hook","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeSchurElements.lean#L63-L68","doc":"Every cell has hook length at least `1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.schurElt_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.schurElt_eq","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeSchurElements.lean#L56-L61","doc":"**Closed form**: `c_λ = Q^{−n(λ)} ∏_x (1 − Q^{h(x)}) / (1 − Q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.schurElt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.schurElt","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeSchurElements.lean#L53-L54","doc":"The **Schur element** `c_λ(Q) = (M_λ(Q))⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}